# Agent Safety

- Never commit secrets, tokens, `.env` files, or credential exports.
- Never run destructive commands without explicit user approval.
- Prefer read-only exploration before editing.
- Treat public MCP servers as untrusted until configured with least privilege.
- Use write-capable tools only when the task has a verifier.
